              "content": "=Analyze each delayed trade separately.\ncheck date exact date and todays date ({{ $now }}) then make decision and give reason about that \nReturn ONLY valid JSON array, no markdown.\n\nFormat:\n[\n  \"cleint mail\",\n\"slack_member_id\",\n    \"trade data\": [\n      {\n    \"trade_id\": \"\",\n    \"stock\": \" \",\n    \"reason\": \" Give Possible Reasons for why this trade might delayed (reasons of delay not other things like it indicates and its delayed but real reasons)\",\n    \"severity\": \"LOW | MEDIUM | HIGH\",\n    \"action\": \"\",\n    \n  }\n    ]\n]\n\nInput:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.ai_input) }}"
