        -64
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 5,
        "width": 592,
        "height": 704,
        "content": "### Automated Trade Settlement Monitoring & Alert System\n\n### How it works:\nThis workflow runs daily to monitor trade settlements from Google Sheets. It validates settlement dates, detects delayed trades, and groups them by client. Each client’s delayed trades are analyzed using AI to generate reasons, severity, and recommended actions. Based on severity, alerts are sent via Slack and detailed reports are emailed to clients.\n\n### Setup steps:\n\nConnect Google Sheets (trade data source)\nConfigure Gemini API credentials (AI analysis)\nConnect Gmail account (email notifications)\nConnect Slack account (user alerts)\nEnsure sheet includes required fields (trade id, stock name, settlement date, status, client email, slack id)\nAdjust schedule timing if needed"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "911306b7-2e0f-48a4-83fc-79f3ba8c7366",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        576,
        96
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 3,
        "width": 432,
        "height": 544,
        "content": "### Data Source\nThis section is responsible for fetching all trade records from Google Sheets on a scheduled basis. It ensures the workflow always works with the latest available data for accurate monitoring."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "76f897c3-cfdb-4777-9307-54ae8407a62e",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1088,
        96
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 3,
        "width": 432,
        "height": 544,
        "content": "### Data Cleaning & Validation\nIn this step, raw data from the sheet is normalized into a consistent structure. It also validates settlement dates and flags missing or invalid values to prevent errors in later processing."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "3116d80f-df7e-4157-a1b9-5b30ca2a71f2",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1584,
        96
